        "text": "Analyze this bank transfer screenshot and extract the transaction details.\n\nREQUIRED OUTPUT FORMAT (JSON only):\n{\n  \"extracted_data\": {\n    \"amount\": number,\n    \"date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n    \"transaction_id\": \"string\",\n    \"sender_account\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"validation\": {\n    \"amount_match\": boolean,\n    \"date_is_recent\": boolean,\n    \"format_valid\": boolean\n  },\n  \"confidence_score\": 0-100,\n  \"recommendation\": \"approve\" | \"review\" | \"reject\",\n  \"reason\": \"string explanation\"\n}\n\nRULES:\n- Amount match: Check if extracted amount is within ±5% of expected_amount = {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.expected_amount }}\n- Recent date: Check if date is within the last 48 hours.\n- Sender check: Check if sender account ends with {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.user_id }} (if applicable/visible).\n- If the image is not a valid bank receipt or transaction screenshot, set recommendation to \"reject\" and confidence_score to 0."
